  abilityId: 1810428
  abilityName: Even Foes Can Play
  abilityDesc: 20 combo powerful Fire attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP, with enormously boosted critical hit rate), adds probability of performing
    up to 2 extra actions within the same turn, boosts Spark damage of Fire types
    for 3 turns, hugely boosts Spark damage for 3 turns, slightly boosts OD gauge
    & hugely boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns
